      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what's being tested.Let me check the working directory and the compile setup.Let me check where `Fixture` is defined in the test classes.I need to find where `Fixture` is defined. Let me look in the AppendableJoinerTest original test file.Now I have all the context I need. The `Fixture` class is a static inner class of `AppendableJoinerTest`. I'll write an improved test that:\n1. Removes unused imports\n2. Formats the builder call properly (no `@formatter:off/on` hints needed)\n3. Defines `Fixture` as a local static inner class to make the test self-contained and readable\n4. Uses a clearer variable name (`stringBuilder` vs `sbuilder`)\n5. Adds brief comments explaining the expected accumulation behavior"
